# The README's opening reel: search, add, list.
Source docs/tapes/common/settings.tape
Output docs/img/hero.gif
Set Height 600

Hide
Type "source docs/tapes/demo-env.sh devdocs_en_go" Enter
Sleep 2s
Show

Type "zimon search wikipedia" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Type "zimon add wikipedia_en_100" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 5.5s
Type "zimon list" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 3.5s
